docs {
  # Clear Notifications
  
  **Method:** `DELETE`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/notifications`
  **Auth:** Required
  
  ## Description
  
  Clears notification inbox for the authenticated user. If `only_read=true`, only read notifications (`id <= last_read_id`) are soft-deleted. If `only_read=false` (default), all active notifications are cleared.
  
  ## Request
  
  ### Query Parameters
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `only_read` | `boolean` | No | If true, only deletes read notifications; if false (default), clears all |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "cleared": true
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid access token
}
